      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "hey its me its verity\nask me anything\ni know about a million things\ni'll do anything\nwhat's the capital of france?\noh, oui oui oui, it is paris\nmerci\nokay, what does the cow say?\noh, moo moo moo, i speak that too\nall day\ndo you live alone\nis anybody home\none two three and so\nwhere did everybody go?",
